their own licenses, attributed below.

================================================================================
Theme — themes/ratio  (keycloak-ratio-theme.jar)
================================================================================

@eventuras/ratio-ui — design system (components, tokens, fonts), bundled
    Copyright Losol AS
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
    https://www.npmjs.com/package/@eventuras/ratio-ui

Keycloakify — build tooling; the generated bootstrap (src/kc.gen.tsx) and the
initial project scaffolding derive from keycloakify / keycloakify-starter.
    Copyright the Keycloakify authors
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
    https://www.keycloakify.dev/

ALTCHA widget — registers the <altcha-widget> custom element, bundled
    npm "altcha" 3.0.11
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
    https://altcha.org/  ·  https://github.com/altcha-org/altcha

================================================================================
Plugin — plugins/tessera-otp  (keycloak-tessera-otp-*.jar, shaded)
================================================================================

The provider JAR is built with the Maven Shade plugin and embeds:

ALTCHA — proof-of-work captcha (server-side challenge generation)
    Java library:  org.altcha:altcha 2.0.2
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
    https://altcha.org/  ·  https://github.com/altcha-org/altcha

android-json — clean-room org.json API implementation (from the Android SDK);
supplies the org.json.* classes ALTCHA's Java lib calls, replacing the reference
org.json:json to keep the distribution free of the non-free "JSON License".
    com.vaadin.external.google:android-json 0.0.20131108.vaadin1
    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/com.vaadin.external.google/android-json

